又像并不在意镜头。她穿黑白配色的哥特女仆风连衣裙，白色围裙、蕾丝边、黑色蝴蝶结、长袖袖口和整齐裙摆结构清晰，裙长覆盖大腿，服装整体偏时尚化、精致化、不过度暴露。下身搭配半透明黑色丝袜和厚底黑色乐福鞋，整体造型带一点日系暗黑学院风与女仆元素融合感。场景是一张薄荷蓝与奶油白配色的欧式贵妃椅，椅背和扶手有雕花与做旧金属钉装饰，背景墙面为冷薄荷蓝色，整体空间简洁。光线为柔和均匀的室内漫射光，略带冷调，照亮人物脸部、头发、裙面褶皱与沙发纹理，整体黑、白、薄荷蓝三色关系明确，画面精致、冷感、时尚、带一点二次元审美但仍偏真实摄影，像一张高级女仆主题时尚大片"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "optional_prompt_list", "link": 38, "label": "optional_prompt_list", "type": "LIST", "localized_name": "optional_prompt_list"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_1"}, "name": "prompt_1", "label": "prompt_1", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_1"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_2"}, "name": "prompt_2", "label": "prompt_2", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_2"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_3"}, "name": "prompt_3", "label": "prompt_3", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_3"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_4"}, "name": "prompt_4", "label": "prompt_4", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_4"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt_5"}, "name": "prompt_5", "label": "prompt_5", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt_5"}], "flags": {}, "type": "easy promptList", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [406.0674133300781, 730.5181274414062], "pos": [-96.67430114746094, 849.250732421875], "id": 32, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy promptList"}, "order": 14}, {"outputs": [{"shape": 3, "name": "SEED", "links": [14, 34], "label": "SEED", "dir": 4, "type": "INT"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": [916533586394673, "", "", ""], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Seed (rgthree)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [315, 130], "pos": [375.3360290527344, 656.004150390625], "id": 15, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "image_urls", "label": "image_urls", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "image_urls"}], "size": [530.0242309570312, 395.3286437988281], "pos": [1690.5543212890625, 817.8780517578125], "widgets_values": ["Z-Image-turbo-PurpleGrainy"], "inputs": [{"nam